PTX MP+volatile+fences+dsmem-local
"Message passing in the own CTA's shared memory through the cluster window, a volatile flag with fence.acq_rel.sys"
{
x=0 @cta 0;
f=0 @cta 0;
P1:r0=0;
P1:r1=0;
}
 P0@cta 0,cluster 0,gpu 0         | P1@cta 0,cluster 0,gpu 0          ;
 st.weak.shared::cluster x, 1     | ld.volatile.shared::cluster r0, f ;
 fence.acq_rel.sys                | fence.acq_rel.sys                 ;
 st.volatile.shared::cluster f, 1 | ld.weak.shared::cluster r1, x     ;
exists
(P1:r0 == 1 /\ P1:r1 == 0)
